&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;④　役員ごとの連結報酬等の総額等&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 36px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 612px"&gt;
